ur own  resources as long as we can but at the  very moment when I finally realized how  unprepared i was admitted it my own  resources were running dry I learned  that God prepares a way for us in the  wilderness this is life in the  wilderness when our hunger for success  finally yields to our deeper hunger for  God when our thirst for self-sufficiency  yields finally to our deeper thirst for  peace at the very moment we are about to  turn around and walk the other way God  provides streams of  living water just up ahead rivers of  grace in the desert enough living water  to sustain us in the wilderness as you  walk through these next advent days  until we gather here again try to walk  Christ's way this Advent seeking quiet  places to pray especially when you don't  think you have time forgiving others and  yourselves as Christ has forgiven  resisting the temptation to run out of  the wilderness Christ is coming to meet  you here in the wilderness walk his way  and you will be sustained amen
 

